  input: Due to increasing global climate injustice, developing and developed countries
    from all over the world have banded together and asked for your assistance. They
    have appointed you as a global climate justice judge. Your task is to spend a
    set amount of money provided by developed countries. To promote global climate
    justice while also working to mitigate climate change.                      Good
    luck judge.
